# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.radharc.ThemeFile version 10
event resolved(theme: ResolvedTheme)
```

# DESCRIPTION

The resolved theme as it is kept: `theme/resolved` is one message,
this event, read in place by whoever maps the file.

Protocol `todhchai.radharc.ThemeFile`, version 10, of library `RadharcIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

